WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:05.550
The Maze Runner's third and final cinematic
run, titled The Death Cure, is just as action-packed

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.700
and character-heavy as the previous installments.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:13.080
So, if you lost track of all that went down
in the explosive closing chapter for the sci-fi/adventure

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.430
series, here's the play-by-play on what exactly
happened to all those Greenies and Gladers

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.590
in the end.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.650
The rescue riot

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:24.080
A good chunk of the movie is dedicated solely
to rescuing Minho from the clutches of the

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:28.580
WICKED scientists, including our old frenemy
Teresa, who are treating him and other immune

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:32.099
kids like lab rats in the hope of siphoning
off a cure.

00:00:32.099 --> 00:00:36.380
After their first wildly unbelievable train
car heist fails to save him, they decide to

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.800
storm the "Last City."

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.980
"Maybe?"

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.620
This is a bona fide techno-fortress that has
been built to keep the uninfected population

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:49.030
safe from the "cranks," and it's specifically
designed to keep undesirables like Thomas,

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.090
Newt, and Frypan from getting in.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:56.000
There's a big price to pay for getting through:
they'll need to rely on a rogue group of insurgents

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.820
that are lingering outside of the wall, waiting
for an opportunity to come in and wreck the

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.820
place.

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.110
And wreck it they do.

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:05.939
With the help of Gally, who's decided to be
on Team Glader again after his unfortunate

00:01:05.939 --> 00:01:10.770
reaction to a sting, Thomas and friends infiltrate
the wall through the tunnel system and make

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.390
way to the WICKED lab building where Minho
and other kids are being held.

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:19.719
In return, Gally's friends in the havoc-wreaking
army get access to come in and blow everything

00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:20.719
up.

00:01:20.719 --> 00:01:24.840
But skyscrapers and countless amounts of Last
Citizens aren't the only ones lost in the

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:25.840
fray.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.420
The sacrifice

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:31.540
About halfway through the rescue mission for
Minho, we learn that Newt has been infected

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:35.240
with the now-airborne virus that's been plaguing
people around the globe.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:39.140
He manages to power through some of the most
difficult moments but before the group can

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:43.380
make it back to their rendezvous point for
rescue, he begins to succumb to the zombifying

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:44.500
disease.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.849
Thomas tries his best to bring him back from
the infection's haze until some serum is dropped

00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:53.329
off, but when the now-mad Newt whips out a
knife, it's hopeless.

00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:56.399
Thomas turns the weapon on his best friend,
and that's that.

00:01:56.399 --> 00:01:58.549
And just when they got one of the crew back,
too.

00:01:58.549 --> 00:02:03.739
But, hey, at least Frypan and Brenda are able
to save a literal busload of the other immune

00:02:03.739 --> 00:02:07.490
kids by literally hoisting them over the wall
with a crane.

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:08.759
The death cure

00:02:08.759 --> 00:02:13.000
The reunion between Thomas and Teresa is not
a happy one at first.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:17.090
After the guys are able to nab her on the
street, have her remove their tracking devices,

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:21.540
and then lead them to Minho's holding chamber,
it's clear she's not too tormented over whether

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:22.590
what she's doing is ethical.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.680
"I did what I thought was right."

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:29.200
In her mind, there are people dying every
day of this horrific disease, and she's desperate

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.870
to find a cure for the infection, even if
it means torturing kids like Minho.

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:38.319
While Minho's blood serum manages to stave
off the infection temporarily, her experiment

00:02:38.319 --> 00:02:41.540
with little Cheyenne proves that it doesn't
work for long.

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:46.439
Minho's not the answer, even if WICKED would
still prefer to bleed him dry anyway.

00:02:46.439 --> 00:02:50.650
Realizing that, she's more earnest in her
effort to help her old Maze pals rescue him

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:57.120
and escape — until she realizes that Thomas'
blood is what she's been looking for all along.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.090
The WCKD collapse

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.810
Just as Thomas is attempting to exit the city,
Teresa lures him back to the lab by telling

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:07.680
him that it's his blood which can save everyone
from certain infection.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:11.280
Thomas can't help but be the good guy and
tries to turn himself in for service.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:15.990
Unfortunately, upon his arrival, and Ava's
promise to take care of his friends in exchange

00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:21.040
for his cooperation, her sniveling henchman
Janson decides now is the perfect time to

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.040
betray her.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:27.060
He incapacitates Thomas and takes him hostage
because Janson himself needs the cure.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:31.489
Thomas and Teresa outsmart him, of course,
but escaping that peril isn't the end of their

00:03:31.489 --> 00:03:32.489
struggle.

00:03:32.489 --> 00:03:36.440
They soon find themselves on the roof of the
burning building as mass chaos continues to

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.020
erupt outside.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:41.810
Although Jorge is able to get a hovercraft
to the roof through a major movie miracle

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:47.049
and rescue Thomas, it's too late for Teresa
and the remnants of WCKD.

00:03:47.049 --> 00:03:48.540
The next run

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.900
Thomas wakes up on a remote island with the
rest of the runaways under Vince's care, and

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.659
it's an actual paradise.

00:03:54.659 --> 00:03:59.549
But as Thomas reflects Newt's sacrifice, he
knows he's not ready to settle down.

00:03:59.549 --> 00:04:03.939
Now that he knows he's the cure for the whole
world, can he stay away from the action forever?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.820
"That's what I'm afraid of."

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:07.090
Thanks for watching!

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:09.519
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:04:09.519 --> 00:04:11.530
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

